{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"vue","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Vue","description":"Syntax coloring and snippets for Vue (.vue).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"vue","name":"Vue","extensions":[".vue"],"grammar":"grammars/vue.json","blockComment":["<!--","-->"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Vue","path":"snippets/vue.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/vue.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"<!\\\\-\\\\-\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\-\\\\->\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"</?[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9-]*\",\n      \"token\": \"tag\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[:@#]?v-[a-z-]+|[:@][A-Za-z.\\\\-]+|#[a-z]+(?==)\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[A-Za-z-]+(?==)\",\n      \"token\": \"attribute\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"/?>\",\n      \"token\": \"tag\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\{\\\\{|\\\\}\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/vue.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Single file component\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"vue\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<script setup lang=\\\"ts\\\">\",\n      \"$1\",\n      \"</script>\",\n      \"\",\n      \"<template>\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"</template>\",\n      \"\",\n      \"<style scoped>\",\n      \"</style>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A single file component\"\n  },\n  \"Ref\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ref\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:name} = ref(${2:0})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A ref\"\n  },\n  \"Computed\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"comp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:name} = computed(() => ${2:value})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A computed value\"\n  },\n  \"Props\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"props\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const props = defineProps<{ ${1:name}: ${2:string} }>()\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Define props\"\n  },\n  \"Emit\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"emit\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const emit = defineEmits<{ (e: '${1:change}', value: ${2:string}): void }>()\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Define emits\"\n  },\n  \"v-for\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"vfor\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<li v-for=\\\"${1:item} in ${2:items}\\\" :key=\\\"${1:item}.id\\\">{{ ${1:item} }}</li>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A v-for list\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Vue\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Vue.\n\n## Files\n\n`.vue`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- 6 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `vue` | A single file component |\n| `ref` | A ref |\n| `comp` | A computed value |\n| `props` | Define props |\n| `emit` | Define emits |\n| `vfor` | A v-for list |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}